Author: CusDeb OS Team
Description: browseui, shdocvw: Scale the file browser bars and their images to the DPI.
 The toolbar, the Go button, the explorer bar close button and the
 Favorites band toolbar use 96 DPI image strips; enlarge them by a whole
 factor with pixel replication. Scale the sizes of the explorer bar, the
 search pane, the Folders and Favorites bands and the address band, the
 toolbar border space and the maximum height of the autocomplete list to
 the screen DPI.
